  m_text: 18 years old. Pink hedgehog with a giant sledge which she takes everywhere
    she goes. She has a bad memory of her past except that she learned karate when
    she was cream's age. She is friends with team Sonic, and is best friends with
    Cream. When she was 4, she experienced an full-scaled invasion of soldiers in
    her safe place in kiev and that caused her to escape that world and come to her
    current safe place.
